  "body_html": "\n\n\t<h2>Award-Winning DJ Company for Weddings &amp; Events</h2>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs is an award-winning DJ company trusted for weddings, Bar and Bat Mitzvahs, school dances, corporate events, private parties, photo booth rentals, uplighting, production lighting, and special event entertainment. We know how important entertainment is for your celebration, so our team takes every event seriously from planning to the final song.</p>\n<p>Our awards and accolades reflect years of client trust, consistent service, and real event experience. However, the biggest recognition comes from the couples, families, schools, companies, and event planners who continue to choose JAMMIN&#8217; DJs for their most important celebrations.</p>\n<h3>Trusted Event Entertainment</h3>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs provides professional DJ entertainment, MC services, photo booth options, decor lighting, uplighting, production lighting, and atmospheric effects, including Cold Sparks where permitted by the venue and local regulations.</p>\n<p>Whether you are planning a wedding reception, mitzvah, prom, homecoming, company party, birthday celebration, or private event, our goal is to help create a smooth, high-energy experience your guests will remember.</p>\n<h3>The Knot Awards</h3>\n<p>The Knot awards recognize wedding professionals who have earned strong client feedback and built trust with couples. JAMMIN&#8217; DJs is proud to have received recognition from The Knot for wedding entertainment and client service.</p>\n<p>You can also explore wedding planning resources directly through <a href=\"https://www.theknot.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Knot</a>.</p>\n\n\t\t<style>\n\t\t\t#gallery-18 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-18 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t\twidth: 25%;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-18 img {\n\t\t\t\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-18 .gallery-capti