ades for excellence.\" srcset=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2014-5ea11fa295e40-150x150.png 150w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2014-5ea11fa295e40.png 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2010-tk-5ea51901d2a89.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2010-tk-5ea51901d2a89-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"2010 pick the knot best of weddings awards.\" srcset=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2010-tk-5ea51901d2a89-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2010-tk-5ea51901d2a89.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2007-tk-5ea51900d3161.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2007-tk-5ea51900d3161-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"2007 pick the knot best of weddings. Awards\" srcset=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2007-tk-5ea51900d3161-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2007-tk-5ea51900d3161.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl>\n\t\t\t<br style='clear: both' />\n\t\t</div>\n\n<h3>WeddingWire Awards</h3>\n<p>WeddingWire recognition is another important trust signal for couples comparing wedding DJs, MCs, photo booths, lighting, and reception entertainment. These awards help show the level of care JAMMIN&#8217; DJs brings to wedding celebrations.</p>\n<p>For more wedding vendor planning tools, visit <a href=\"https://www.weddingwire.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WeddingWire</a>.</p>\n\n\t\t<style>\n\t\t\t#gallery-19 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-19 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t\twidth: 25%;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-19 img {\n\t\t\t\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-19 .gallery-caption {\n\t\t\t\tmargin-left: 0;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes/media.php */\n\t\t</style>\n\t\t<div id='gallery-19' class='gallery galleryid-4565 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-thumbnail'><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/2021-ww-1.png'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/2021-ww-1.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"WeddingWire Couples&#039; Choice Awards 2021: Georgia Corporate DJ.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2020-ww-5ea122613a917.png'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2020-ww-5ea122613a917-150x150.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Weddingwire accolades: Couples&#039; Choice Awards 2020.\" srcset=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2020-ww-5ea122613a917-150x150.png 150w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2020-ww-5ea122613a917.png 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/2019-ww-5ea122601d648.png'><img loading=\"lazy\" dec